OL,6, SOUTH YORKSHIREBHome Secretary bans
OL,7,Bmore marchesG.......................102
OL,9, POLAND:BUnion leaders to have talks
OL,10,Bwith the government tomorrowG.......103
OL,12, WALES:BFlood alerts after continued
OL,13,Bheavy rainG.........................104
OL,15, SPAIN:BPrime Minister visits
OL,16, BBasque regionG.....................105
OL,18, FTeachers support 7\% pay offerG..106
OL,19, FUlster: Man shot in bomb raidG...116
OL,20,  Rugby:FFrance hold England 16-12G153
OL,21,        FScotland beat IrelandG....154
