OL,6, The Polish union Solidarity is to hold
OL,7, talks with the Government over clashes
OL,8, in the northern city of Bydgoszcz.
OL,10,BThe talks tomorrow follow demands by
OL,11,Bthe union, after violence in the city
OL,12,Bbetween union members and police.
OL,14,BThe union wants the dismissal of a
OL,15,Bnumber of officials, including the
OL,16,Bcity's deputy governor, the local
OL,17,Bcommunist party secretary, and the
OL,18,Bpolice commander.
OL,19,B
OL,20,BThe union has threatened a national
OL,21,Bstrike if the demands were not met.
OL,23,T]CFromG21-03-80C/ teletextarchive.com
