OL,6, Many parts of Wales are facing the
OL,7, threat of more floods after continued
OL,8, heavy rain.
OL,10,FFlood alerts have been issued and an
OL,11,Femergency operations room has been set
OL,12,Fup in Brecon.
OL,13,F
OL,14,FBad weather condtions are also
OL,15,Faffecting areas of Scotland where snow
OL,16,Fhas made some roads impassable.
OL,17,F
OL,18,FThe weathermen say more snow is
OL,19,Fexpected in Scotland tonight - and may
OL,20,Fspread to northern parts of England and
OL,21,FWales tomorrow.
OL,23,T]CFromG21-03-80C/ teletextarchive.com
