OL,6, The Prime Minister of Spain has visited
OL,7, the Basque region in a bid to defuse
OL,8, rising tensions.
OL,10,BLeopoldo Calvo Sotelo attended the
OL,11,Bfuneral of an army colonel killed by
OL,12,BBasque separatists.
OL,14,BIt is feared the shooting may spark a
OL,15,Bnew round of violence in the region.
OL,17,BThe killing - the 24th senior military
OL,18,Bofficer to die in the past three years
OL,19,B- was claimed by the separatist group,
OL,20,BETA.
OL,21,B
OL,23,T]CFromG21-03-80C/ teletextarchive.com
