OL,6, Teachers' union representatives have
OL,7, voted to back a 7\ per cent pay deal.
OL,9,FIt means the average teachers' salary
OL,10,Fwill be about #8,000 a year.
OL,12,FNUT General Secretary Fred Jarvis said
OL,13,Fan agreement for a working party to
OL,14,Fexamine the structure of teachers' pay
OL,15,Fwas an important part of the settlement
OL,16,F
OL,17,C*FEducation Secretary Mark Carlisle has
OL,18,Frejected claims that government cuts
OL,19,Fcould lead to overcrowded schools when
OL,20,Fthe number of pupils rises again.
OL,21,F
OL,22,FHe said by 1986, three million fewer
OL,23,Fplaces would be needed.
