OL,6, A security man has been shot in the leg
OL,7, during an attack on an electrical shop
OL,8, in Belfast.
OL,10,FThe man was shot by people who placed
OL,11,Ftwo bombs in the building in Ormeau
OL,12,FRoad not far from the city centre.
OL,14,FFire broke out after the bombs exploded
OL,15,Fbut was later put out.
OL,17,FThe security man is said to be not
OL,18,Fseriously injured. No-one else was hurt
OL,19,Fin the attack.
OL,22,F
OL,23,T]CFromG21-03-80C/ teletextarchive.com
