OL,6, The EEC has again come to the rescue of
OL,7, anyone in Britain who feels life is too
OL,8, simple and easy to understand.
OL,10,FAlmost all diaries in Britain say that
OL,11,Ftomorrow is the day for clocks to go
OL,12,Fforward for the start of British Summer
OL,13,FTime.
OL,15,FBut "to facilitate co-ordination among
OL,16,FEEC member states" the change will now
OL,17,Fbe put off till NEXT week end.
OL,19,FSo when you turn up for Church an hour
OL,20,Fearly (or an hour late) you'll know who
OL,21,Fto blame....
OL,23,T]CFromG21-03-80C/ teletextarchive.com
