OL,5, MG  C   ENGLANDG12-16C FRANCE
OL,7, France held on despite fierce second
OL,8, half pressure from England to score a
OL,9, memorable win at Twickenham - and so
OL,10, complete the grand slam.
OL,12,FThe French dominated the first half
OL,13,Fwith some controlled rugby, scoring two
OL,14,Ftries from Lacans and Pardo.
OL,15,F
OL,16,FGuy Laporte kicked a conversion and
OL,17,Fkicked two marvellous drop goals to
OL,18,Fgive them a 16-0 lead at half-time.
OL,19,F
OL,20,FEngland fought back after the break
OL,21,Fwith full-back Marcus Rose kicking four
OL,22,Fpenalties - but the crucial score
OL,23,Falways looked beyond them.
